					Effort:    1,
					Why:       "Migrated from legacy insight",
				},
				Decision: distill.Decision{
					State:  state,
					Reason: reason,
					At:     time.Now().UTC().Format(time.RFC3339),
				},
			}
			doc.Lessons = append(doc.Lessons, lesson)
			return nil
		})
		if err != nil {
			return err
		}
	}

	return nil
